
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CampoDirecto Intelligence | ERP + CRM + Digital Twins</title>
<style>
:root{
 --bg:#071b13;--panel:#102b20;--panel2:#173829;--green:#a8d77a;
 --green2:#4f9c65;--gold:#e5c56a;--text:#f1f7ef;
 --muted:#a3b8a7;--border:#ffffff18;--red:#e77e70;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif}
button,input,select{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
.app{min-height:100vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:235px 1fr}
.sidebar{
 background:#081e15;border-right:1px solid var(--border);
 padding:22px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:23px;
}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 8px}
.brand-icon{
 width:43px;height:43px;border-radius:50%;background:#234d35;
 display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:25px;border:1px solid #a8d77a55
}
.brand strong{font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.brand small{display:block;color:var(--green);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px}
.nav-label{font-size:9px;color:#789582;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:0 10px}
.nav{display:grid;gap:5px}
.nav button{
 display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;border:0;
 background:transparent;color:#b7c9bb;text-align:left;padding:11px 12px;
 border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;transition:.2s
}
.nav button:hover,.nav button.active{background:#2b633e;color:white}
.nav button span{font-size:16px;width:19px;text-align:center}
.sidebar-bottom{margin-top:auto}
.ai-box{
 background:linear-gradient(145deg,#1a4930,#10291e);
 border:1px solid #b0d58c30;padding:15px;border-radius:13px
}
.ai-box h3{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 7px}
.ai-box p{font-size:10px;color:#bdd0c0;line-height:1.6}
.ai-box button{background:#477b43;color:white;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:9px;width:100%;font-size:10px}
.main{min-width:0}
.topbar{
 height:70px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;
 align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 25px;gap:15px;
 background:#0b2118
}
.search{max-width:420px;width:100%;position:relative}
.search input{
 width:100%;border-radius:30px;border:1px solid var(--border);
 background:#ffffff0b;padding:12px 16px 12px 38px;color:white;outline:none
}
.search span{position:absolute;left:13px;top:10px}
.top-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.avatar{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#527e54;display:grid;place-items:center}
.content{padding:22px 25px 35px;max-width:1650px;margin:auto}
.welcome{
 position:relative;border-radius:17px;overflow:hidden;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0b281b 0%,#102f2088 60%,#102f2033),
 url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85") center 48%/cover;
 padding:25px 24px;min-height:155px;margin-bottom:17px
}
.welcome h1{font-size:25px;margin:0 0 6px}
.welcome p{font-size:11px;color:#d2e0d1;margin:0}
.welcome-tag{display:inline-block;background:#ffffff1b;border:1px solid #ffffff35;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:9px;margin-top:15px}
.page{display:none}
.page.active{display:block}
.grid{display:grid;gap:13px}
.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin-bottom:14px}
.card{
 background:linear-gradient(145deg,#183a29e8,#102a20f0);
 border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;padding:16px;
 box-shadow:0 7px 25px #00000016
}
.stat-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#c0d1c1;font-size:10px}
.stat-icon{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:10px;background:#a8d77a20;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:16px}
.stat-number{font-size:28px;font-weight:750;margin:10px 0 4px}
.stat-foot{font-size:9px;color:var(--green)}
.dashboard-grid{grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1.15fr .9fr;margin-bottom:14px}
.card-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:750;margin-bottom:5px}
.card-sub{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px}
.field-photo{
 height:205px;border-radius:10px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 background:linear-gradient(#0c301855,#0c301855),
 url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472396961693-142e6e269027?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80") center/cover
}
.pin{
 position:absolute;width:24px;height:24px;background:#a8d77a;
 color:#16361f;border:3px solid #ffffffa8;border-radius:50%;
 display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:10px;box-shadow:0 0 15px #a8d77a
}
.pin.one{left:22%;top:30%}.pin.two{left:59%;top:55%}.pin.three{right:17%;top:22%}
.field-label{
 position:absolute;bottom:12px;left:12px;background:#0a2119e8;
 padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:10px
}
.progress-line{height:7px;background:#ffffff17;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:8px 0}
.progress-line span{height:100%;display:block;background:var(--green);border-radius:20px}
.weather-main{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:35px;margin:10px 0}
.weather-main small{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.weather-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px;margin-top:15px}
.weather-grid div{background:#ffffff0a;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 5px;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted)}
.weather-grid b{display:block;color:white;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}
.bottom-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}
.donut-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:15px}
.donut{
 width:130px;height:130px;border-radius:50%;
 background:conic-gradient(#a8d77a 0 35%,#e4c566 35% 70%,#4c9360 70% 91%,#d77b6b 91%);
 display:grid;place-items:center
}
.donut-inner{width:91px;height:91px;border-radius:50%;background:#153526;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:800}
.donut-inner small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.legend{font-size:9px;color:#c2d0c3;display:grid;gap:9px}
.legend span{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}
.bar-chart{height:130px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff22;padding:5px 4px}
.bar{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(#a8d77a,#4d9361);border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;position:relative;min-width:12px}
.bar small{position:absolute;bottom:-20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:8px;color:var(--muted)}
.activity{display:grid;gap:12px}
.activity-item{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:10px}
.activity-icon{width:28px;height:28px;background:#a8d77a1c;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.activity-item small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px}
.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:12px 0 17px}
.section-heading h2{font-size:21px;margin:0}
.section-heading p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0}
.action{
 background:#a8d77a;color:#122b1b;border:0;padding:10px 14px;
 border-radius:8px;font-weight:800;font-size:10px
}
.secondary{background:#ffffff13;color:white;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:10px}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:590px}
th{text-align:left;color:#8ea996;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.7px;padding:12px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
td{padding:13px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff0c;font-size:10px;color:#d9e5d9}
.status{padding:5px 8px;border-radius:20px;font-size:9px;background:#a8d77a20;color:#b9e28c;white-space:nowrap}
.status.warn{background:#e5c56a20;color:#e5c56a}
.status.danger{background:#e77e7020;color:#f39b8e}
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
.form-grid label{display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:10px;color:#a9bcae}
.form-grid input,.form-grid select,.form-grid textarea{
 width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;
 background:#0b2118;color:white;outline:none
}
.form-grid button{grid-column:1/-1}
.twin-grid{grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr}
.twin-visual{
 min-height:290px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;
 background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0b241377,#0b2417aa),
 url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85") center/cover
}
.twin-overlay{position:absolute;inset:15px;border:1px solid #b4df8c66;border-radius:10px;pointer-events:none}
.twin-point{
 position:absolute;background:#b5df86;color:#12311d;border-radius:50%;
 width:17px;height:17px;box-shadow:0 0 0 7px #a8d77a33
}
.twin-point.a{left:25%;top:25%}.twin-point.b{left:63%;top:43%}.twin-point.c{left:44%;top:72%}
.twin-caption{position:absolute;bottom:15px;left:15px;background:#092116e8;padding:12px;border-radius:9px;font-size:10px}
.twin-controls{display:grid;gap:13px}
.range-row{font-size:10px;color:#c4d5c5}
.range-row input{width:100%;accent-color:#a8d77a;margin-top:10px}
.metric{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px}
.metric b{color:var(--green)}
.alert{
 padding:11px;border-radius:9px;background:#e5c56a17;color:#e5c56a;
 font-size:10px;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.6
}
.ai-message{padding:13px;background:#ffffff0a;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#d5e4d6;line-height:1.7}
.ai-input{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
.ai-input input{flex:1;min-width:0;background:#0a2118;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:11px;color:white;border-radius:8px}
.ai-input button{border:0;background:var(--green);border-radius:8px;padding:0 13px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:18px;color:#78917e;font-size:9px}
.mobile-menu{display:none}
@media(max-width:1050px){
 .app{grid-template-columns:190px 1fr}
 .dashboard-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
 .dashboard-grid .weather-card{grid-column:1/-1}
 .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media(max-width:720px){
 .app{display:block}
 .sidebar{display:none;position:fixed;z-index:20;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:260px;overflow:auto}
 .sidebar.open{display:flex}
 .mobile-menu{display:block;background:#ffffff12;border:1px solid var(--border);color:white;padding:9px;border-radius:8px}
 .topbar{padding:0 13px;height:62px}
 .top-right .date{display:none}
 .content{padding:14px}
 .welcome{padding:22px 16px;min-height:140px}
 .welcome h1{font-size:21px}
 .stats{gap:8px}
 .card{padding:12px}
 .stat-number{font-size:22px}
 .dashboard-grid,.bottom-grid,.twin-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .dashboard-grid .weather-card{grid-column:auto}
 .section-heading h2{font-size:17px}
 .form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .form-grid button{grid-column:auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">

<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
 <div class="brand">
  <div class="brand-icon">🌱</div>
  <div><strong>CampoDirecto</strong><small>INTELLIGENCE</small></div>
 </div>

 <div>
  <div class="nav-label">GESTIÓN EMPRESARIAL</div>
  <nav class="nav">
   <button class="active" data-page="dashboard"><span>▦</span> Dashboard</button>
   <button data-page="erp"><span>▤</span> ERP / Operaciones</button>
   <button data-page="inventory"><span>📦</span> Inventario</button>
   <button data-page="products"><span>🌾</span> Productos</button>
   <button data-page="orders"><span>🛒</span> Pedidos y ventas</button>
   <button data-page="suppliers"><span>🤝</span> Productores</button>
  </nav>
 </div>

 <div>
  <div class="nav-label">RELACIONES COMERCIALES</div>
  <nav class="nav">
   <button data-page="crm"><span>👥</span> CRM / Clientes</button>
   <button data-page="leads"><span>🎯</span> Oportunidades</button>
   <button data-page="quotes"><span>📋</span> Cotizaciones</button>
  </nav>
 </div>

 <div>
  <div class="nav-label">AGRICULTURA INTELIGENTE</div>
  <nav class="nav">
   <button data-page="twins"><span>🌍</span> Gemelos digitales</button>
   <button data-page="fields"><span>🌱</span> Parcelas y cultivos</button>
   <button data-page="weather"><span>☀️</span> Clima y suelo</button>
   <button data-page="reports"><span>📊</span> Reportes</button>
   <button data-page="alerts"><span>🔔</span> Alertas</button>
  </nav>
 </div>

 <div class="sidebar-bottom">
  <div class="ai-box">
   <h3>✦ CampoDirecto AI</h3>
   <p>Asistente demostrativo para consultar datos y recomendaciones de gestión agrícola.</p>
   <button onclick="showPage('assistant')">Consultar asistente →</button>
  </div>
 </div>
</aside>

<main class="main">
 <header class="topbar">
  <button class="mobile-menu" onclick="document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button>
  <div class="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="globalSearch" placeholder="Buscar clientes, productos, operaciones..."></div>
  <div class="top-right">
   <span class="date" id="today"></span>
   <span>🔔</span><span>＋</span><div class="avatar">👩🏻</div>
  </div>
 </header>

 <div class="content">

 <div class="welcome">
  <h1>Bienvenida a CampoDirecto 🌱</h1>
  <p>Centro inteligente de gestión agrícola, comercial y empresarial.</p>
  <div class="welcome-tag">ECUADOR · COMERCIO AGRÍCOLA · ERP + CRM + DIGITAL TWINS</div>
 </div>

 <!-- DASHBOARD -->
 <section class="page active" id="dashboard">
  <div class="grid stats">
   <div class="card">
    <div class="stat-head">Productos registrados <span class="stat-icon">🌾</span></div>
    <div class="stat-number" id="statProducts">10</div>
    <div class="stat-foot">Catálogo agrícola</div>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="stat-head">Unidades en inventario <span class="stat-icon">📦</span></div>
    <div class="stat-number" id="statStock">3.450</div>
    <div class="stat-foot">Stock de demostración</div>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="stat-head">Clientes CRM <span class="stat-icon">👥</span></div>
    <div class="stat-number" id="statClients">8</div>
    <div class="stat-foot">Contactos registrados</div>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="stat-head">Pedidos registrados <span class="stat-icon">🛒</span></div>
    <div class="stat-number" id="statOrders">12</div>
    <div class="stat-foot">Operaciones de ejemplo</div>
   </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid dashboard-grid">
   <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Mapa de parcelas y cultivos</div>
    <div class="card-sub">Vista ilustrativa de zonas agrícolas</div>
    <div class="field-photo">
     <span class="pin one">1</span><span class="pin two">2</span><span class="pin three">3</span>
     <div class="field-label">🌱 Zona agrícola · Carchi, Ecuador</div>
    </div>
   </div>

   <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Indicador de salud agrícola</div>
    <div class="card-sub">Evaluación demostrativa de cultivos</div>
    <div class="donut-wrap">
     <div class="donut"><div class="donut-inner">86<small>Índice / 100</small></div></div>
     <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="dot" style="background:#a8d77a"></i> Excelente 35%</span>
      <span><i class="dot" style="background:#e4c566"></i> Bueno 35%</span>
      <span><i class="dot" style="background:#4c9360"></i> Medio 21%</span>
      <span><i class="dot" style="background:#d77b6b"></i> Bajo 9%</span>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-line"><span style="width:86%"></span></div>
    <div class="stat-foot">Indicador de ejemplo, no diagnóstico real</div>
   </div>

   <div class="card weather-card">
    <div class="card-title">Clima de referencia</div>
    <div class="card-sub">Datos ilustrativos · Región andina</div>
    <div class="weather-main">☀️ 18° <small>Parcialmente nublado</small></div>
    <div class="weather-grid">
     <div>Humedad<b>68%</b></div>
     <div>Viento<b>9 km/h</b></div>
     <div>Lluvia<b>20%</b></div>
    </div>
    <div class="alert">⚠️ Verifica el pronóstico local antes de programar riego o cosecha.</div>
   </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid bottom-grid">
   <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Actividad comercial</div>
    <div class="card-sub">Resumen ilustrativo de operaciones</div>
    <div class="bar-chart">
     <div class="bar" style="height:45%"><small>Lun</small></div>
     <div class="bar" style="height:68%"><small>Mar</small></div>
     <div class="bar" style="height:55%"><small>Mié</small></div>
     <div class="bar" style="height:82%"><small>Jue</small></div>
     <div class="bar" style="height:73%"><small>Vie</small></div>
     <div class="bar" style="height:94%"><small>Sáb</small></div>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Próximas actividades</div>
    <div class="card-sub">Agenda de trabajo</div>
    <div class="activity">
     <div class="activity-item"><span class="activity-icon">📦</span><div>Revisar inventario<small>Control de existencias</small></div></div>
     <div class="activity-item"><span class="activity-icon">🤝</span><div>Contactar compradores<small>Seguimiento comercial</small></div></div>
     <div class="activity-item"><span class="activity-icon">🌱</span><div>Evaluar cultivos<small>Revisión de parcelas</small></div></div>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Distribución de inventario</div>
    <div class="card-sub">Productos de ejemplo</div>
    <div class="legend">
     <span>Papa <b>35%</b></span><div class="progress-line"><span style="width:35%"></span></div>
     <span>Maíz <b>25%</b></span><div class="progress-line"><span style="width:25%"></span></div>
     <span>Fréjol <b>20%</b></span><div class="progress-line"><span style="width:20%"></span></div>
     <span>Otros <b>20%</b></span><div class="progress-line"><span style="width:20%"></span></div>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </section>

 <!-- ERP -->
 <section class="page" id="erp">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2>ERP · Gestión empresarial</h2><p>Control integrado de los procesos de CampoDirecto.</p></div></div>
  <div class="grid stats">
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Compras <span>📥</span></div><div class="stat-number">24</div><div class="stat-foot">Registros de ejemplo</div></div>
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Ventas <span>📤</span></div><div class="stat-number">18</div><div class="stat-foot">Registros de ejemplo</div></div>
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Proveedores <span>🤝</span></div><div class="stat-number">15</div><div class="stat-foot">Productores y aliados</div></div>
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Operaciones <span>⚙️</span></div><div class="stat-number">42</div><div class="stat-foot">Actividad de muestra</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
   <div class="card-title">Módulos del sistema</div><br>
   <div class="grid stats">
    <button class="secondary" onclick="showPage('inventory')">📦 Inventario</button>
    <button class="secondary" onclick="showPage('products')">🌾 Productos</button>
    <button class="secondary" onclick="showPage('orders')">🛒 Pedidos</button>
    <button class="secondary" onclick="showPage('suppliers')">🤝 Productores</button>
   </div>
   <p class="card-sub">Esta versión integra módulos de demostración en una interfaz común. Los procesos contables, facturación electrónica y conexión con SENAE requieren integraciones adicionales.</p>
  </div>
 </section>

 <!-- INVENTORY -->
 <section class="page" id="inventory">
  <div class="section-heading">
   <div><h2>Gestión de inventario</h2><p>Control de existencias y niveles mínimos.</p></div>
   <button class="action" onclick="document.getElementById('inventoryForm').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">＋ Nuevo producto</button>
  </div>
  <div class="grid stats">
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Productos</div><div class="stat-number" id="invCount">5</div></div>
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Unidades</div><div class="stat-number" id="invUnits">3450</div></div>
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Stock bajo</div><div class="stat-number" id="invLow">1</div></div>
   <div class="card"><div class="stat-head">Valor estimado</div><div class="stat-number" id="invValue">$0</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
   <div class="card-title">Productos en almacén</div><br>
   <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Producto</th><th>Categoría</th><th>Stock</th><th>Mínimo</th><th>Estado</th><th>Acción</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventoryTable"></tbody></table></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card" id="inventoryForm" style="margin-top:14px">
